<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Learn to build heavily armored battle tanks such as the marshal, equipped with a variety of weapons. In order to research this project, a marshal wreck needs to be found and restored.-->
  <VVE_BattleTanks.description>研究制造重型战斗载具，例如将帅坦克这一包含了多种武器东西战斗平台。需要从残骸里重建一辆将帅坦克才能研究这一科技。</VVE_BattleTanks.description>
  <VVE_BattleTanks.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->battle tank production-->
    <li>subject-&gt;主战坦克制造</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->initiated the era of armored warfare by resurrecting the prowess of a marshal wreck-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;重建将帅坦克，让装甲铁骑的时代再度归来</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->combined devastating firepower with impenetrable armor to dominate the battlefield-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;将强大的火力与坚固的装甲融为一体，所向无敌</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->dominating with armored might-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;用坦克的力量主宰战场</li>
  </VVE_BattleTanks.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: battle tanks-->
  <VVE_BattleTanks.label>主战坦克</VVE_BattleTanks.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to build large, long-distance trucks such as the big rig or hermano, capable of delivering large amounts of cargo over extremely long distances. In order to research this project, a big rig or hermano wreck needs to be found and restored.-->
  <VVE_BigRigs.description>研究制造长距离大型货运载具，例如大管卡车和同袍卡车，可以将大量货物送往千里之外的目的地。需要从残骸里重建一辆大管卡车或同袍卡车才能研究这一科技。</VVE_BigRigs.description>
  <VVE_BigRigs.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->big rig trucking-->
    <li>subject-&gt;远程卡车制造</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->advanced to constructing monumental long-haul trucks like the big rig or hermano, following the recovery and study of a wreck-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;重建一辆大管卡车或同袍卡车，将先进货运的技术纳入手中</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->dramatically increased cargo capacity and operational range for ground transport-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;大大增强陆路运输的载货量和有效距离</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->revolutionizing overland cargo delivery-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;成就一场陆运行业的革命</li>
  </VVE_BigRigs.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: big rigs-->
  <VVE_BigRigs.label>远程物流</VVE_BigRigs.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to build a dual-rotor cargo helicopter called cherokee, capable of delivering thousands of kilograms of resources via air routes. In order to research this project, a cherokee wreck needs to be found and restored.-->
  <VVE_Cherokee.description>山民直升机是一种重型运输直升机，堪称空中巨兽。它巨大的机体拖慢了它的速度，也需求着大量燃料才能运行，同时也赋予了它无与伦比的载货空间。\n\n一种专业的货运直升机，需要两名飞行员才能驾驶，需要时常补充燃料，这换来的是同等技术等级下无可比拟的载货能力。\n\n&lt;color=#bb8f04&gt;乘员：&lt;/color&gt;飞行员 x2\n&lt;color=#bb8f04&gt;动力：&lt;/color&gt;化合燃料</VVE_Cherokee.description>
  <VVE_Cherokee.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->cherokee helicopter creation-->
    <li>subject-&gt;重型直升机制造</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->expanded aerial logistics capabilities by designing the cherokee, a dual-rotor cargo helicopter, requiring the reconstruction of a wreck-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;在从残骸里重建一架双引擎运输直升机——山民直升机后拓展空运物流的能力。</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->facilitated the movement of massive loads via air, bypassing ground-based obstacles-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;不必受崎岖陆地的限制，让货物可以在空中疾行</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->lifting logistics to new heights-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;将物流行业提到新的高度</li>
  </VVE_Cherokee.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: cherokee-->
  <VVE_Cherokee.label>山民直升机</VVE_Cherokee.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to build fancy, classic cars such as the springbok. In order to research this project, a springbok wreck needs to be found and restored.-->
  <VVE_ClassicCars.description>研究制造羚羊轿车这类经典的老爷车。需要从残骸里重建一辆羚羊轿车才能研究这一科技。</VVE_ClassicCars.description>
  <VVE_ClassicCars.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->classic car restoration-->
    <li>subject-&gt;复兴老爷车</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->began the journey of bringing elegance back to the roads by restoring a springbok wreck-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;在重建一辆羚羊轿车后，将那遥远时代的优雅旅行方式唤醒</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->merged timeless designs with modern engineering to recreate the charm of classic cars-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;让这超越时代的艺术感与现代工程学结合出全新的魅力</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->reviving automotive elegance-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;让驾驶成为一种享受</li>
  </VVE_ClassicCars.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: classic cars-->
  <VVE_ClassicCars.label>老爷车</VVE_ClassicCars.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to build light armored vehicles such as the paladin or the badger, that can transport soldiers efficiently and effectively whilst providing them with fire support. In order to research this project, a paladin or badger wreck needs to be found and restored.-->
  <VVE_LightArmoredVehicles.description>探究制造圣骑运兵车和獾式步兵战车这类军用轻型装甲载具，他们在能高效运输士兵的同时还能提供便利的火力支援。需要从残骸里重建一辆圣骑运兵车或獾式步兵战车才能研究这一科技。</VVE_LightArmoredVehicles.description>
  <VVE_LightArmoredVehicles.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->light armored mobility-->
    <li>subject-&gt;机动装甲力量</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->stepped into the realm of tactical versatility by restoring wrecks like the paladin or badger-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;重建了一辆圣骑运兵车或獾式步兵战车，继而进入机动战场的时代</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->designed vehicles that balance speed, protection, and firepower to support troops on the move-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;设计出平衡了速度，防护和火力的战斗载具来辅助步兵</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->enhancing battlefield mobility-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;让战场更加动态</li>
  </VVE_LightArmoredVehicles.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: light armored vehicles-->
  <VVE_LightArmoredVehicles.label>轻装甲单位</VVE_LightArmoredVehicles.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to build a large transport helicopter called louie, that can deliver both cargo and troops over long distances with ease. In order to research this project, a louie wreck needs to be found and restored.-->
  <VVE_Louie.description>鹭式直升机是一种兼具可靠性和灵活性的装甲运输飞行器。它不需要跑道即可起降，也不会一旦着火就立刻散架。\n\n鹭式直升机是泛用型运输直升机，载货载人的空间都有不少。它的装甲在飞行器中还算优秀，方便从战区起降。\n\n&lt;color=#bb8f04&gt;乘员：&lt;/color&gt;飞行员 x1 乘客 x5\n&lt;color=#bb8f04&gt;动力：&lt;/color&gt;化合燃料</VVE_Louie.description>
  <VVE_Louie.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->louie helicopter development-->
    <li>subject-&gt;运输直升机</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->ventured into aerial logistics by learning to build the louie, a large transport helicopter, starting from a wreck-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;重建了一架鹭式直升机，步入空运物流的领域</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->enabled rapid and flexible transport of cargo and troops over vast distances-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;能在遥远的距离上快速便捷的运输人或物</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->mastering aerial transport-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;掌握空运的技艺</li>
  </VVE_Louie.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: louie-->
  <VVE_Louie.label>鹭式直升机</VVE_Louie.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to build offroad jeeps such as the nomad, that can traverse any terrain with ease. In order to research this project, a nomad wreck needs to be found and restored.-->
  <VVE_OffroadJeeps.description>研究制造牧民越野车这类拥有卓越越野性能的吉普车。需要从残骸里重建一辆牧民越野车才能研究这一科技。</VVE_OffroadJeeps.description>
  <VVE_OffroadJeeps.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->offroad jeep construction-->
    <li>subject-&gt;越野吉普车</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->started mastering the craft of building versatile offroad jeeps like the nomad, requiring the restoration of a wreck-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;从残骸开始，学习制造牧民越野车这种坚实多用的越野载具</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->unlocked the potential to explore and operate in previously inaccessible terrains-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;让之前令人望而止步的地形如履平地</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->navigating rugged landscapes-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;轻松穿越崎岖坎坷</li>
  </VVE_OffroadJeeps.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: offroad jeeps-->
  <VVE_OffroadJeeps.label>越野吉普车</VVE_OffroadJeeps.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to build multiple launch rocket systems with the ability to blanket a whole area with missiles. In order to research this project, a burya wreck needs to be found and restored.-->
  <VVE_RocketArtillery.description>研究制造可以火力覆盖大片战地的多管火箭发射载具。需要从残骸里重建一辆暴风火箭炮才能研究这一科技。</VVE_RocketArtillery.description>
  <VVE_RocketArtillery.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->rocket artillery development-->
    <li>subject-&gt;火箭炮兵</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->progressed to assembling multiple launch rocket systems like the burya, necessitating the reconstruction of a wreck-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;重建了一辆暴风火箭炮，学习制造独特的多管火箭发射系统</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->introduced area saturation capabilities with volleys of missiles, transforming area denial and suppression tactics-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;一波又一波的火箭饱和打击让目标陷入火海</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->massing aerial assault-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;钢铁与火焰的暴雨自天而降</li>
  </VVE_RocketArtillery.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: rocket artillery-->
  <VVE_RocketArtillery.label>火箭炮</VVE_RocketArtillery.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to build a powerful, self-propelled artillery such as the famous udar, capable of raining artillery fire on enemies on the local map. In order to research this project, an udar wreck needs to be found and restored.-->
  <VVE_SelfpropelledArtillery.description>研究制造拥有装甲底盘的重型火炮载具，例如重锤自行火炮，可以使用曲射火力轰炸同地图的目标。需要从残骸里重建一辆重锤自行火炮才能研究这一科技。</VVE_SelfpropelledArtillery.description>
  <VVE_SelfpropelledArtillery.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->self-propelled artillery construction-->
    <li>subject-&gt;自行火炮制造</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->embarked on creating the udar, a formidable self-propelled artillery piece, after restoring a wreck-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;重建了一辆重锤自行火炮开始制造此等强大的火力单位</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->enhanced battlefield support with mobile artillery capable of precise, long-range bombardments on local maps-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;给地区战场带来精准的远程炮击</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->deploying strategic firepower-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;一发入魂，扭转战局</li>
  </VVE_SelfpropelledArtillery.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: self-propelled artillery-->
  <VVE_SelfpropelledArtillery.label>自行火炮</VVE_SelfpropelledArtillery.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to build powerful siege pods that act as temporary, moving bases during assaults in enemy territory. In order to research this project, a goliath wreck needs to be found and restored.-->
  <VVE_SiegePods.description>研究制造强大如堡垒一般的运输仓。需要从残骸里重建一台巨灵运输舱才能研究这一科技。</VVE_SiegePods.description>
  <VVE_SiegePods.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->siege pod engineering-->
    <li>subject-&gt;移动堡垒工程学</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->advanced to fabricating siege pods for dynamic assault bases, following the salvage of a goliath wreck-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;重建一台巨灵运输舱，让让随地投放强大的火力堡垒成为可能</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->created mobile bases that can be deployed during assaults, providing logistical and combat support in enemy territory-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;在深入敌后的土地上扎下自己的火力与后勤据点</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->establishing mobile fortresses-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;部署可以移动的堡垒</li>
  </VVE_SiegePods.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: siege pods-->
  <VVE_SiegePods.label>移动堡垒</VVE_SiegePods.label>
  <!--EN: Learn to build fast and luxurious supercars such as the lightning. In order to research this project, a lightning wreck needs to be found and restored.-->
  <VVE_SuperCars.description>研究制造高调奢华的超级跑车，例如闪电超跑。需要从残骸里重建一辆闪电超跑才能研究这一科技。</VVE_SuperCars.description>
  <VVE_SuperCars.generalRules.rulesStrings>
    <!--EN: subject->supercar engineering-->
    <li>subject-&gt;超跑工程</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->advanced to crafting vehicles that epitomize speed and luxury, starting with the restoration of a lightning wreck-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;重建一辆闪电超跑开始，将载具的技艺推向极致的速度与奢华</li>
    <!--EN: subject_story->pushed the limits of performance and aesthetics to create the ultimate driving machines-->
    <li>subject_story-&gt;突破性能与美学的桎梏，制造出傲立于世的载具</li>
    <!--EN: subject_gerund->crafting speed and luxury-->
    <li>subject_gerund-&gt;制造出是纯粹的速度</li>
  </VVE_SuperCars.generalRules.rulesStrings>
  <!--EN: supercars-->
  <VVE_SuperCars.label>超级跑车</VVE_SuperCars.label>
</LanguageData>
